direction: right

s1: "1. the skull\nabout 12 told tables and their triggers\nlaid as one block\nnothing fires yet"
s2: "2. the SQL words\none typed line births\nCREATE TABLE ( ) ; INTEGER PRIMARY KEY ...\nnobody hand-lays CREATE"
s3: "3. born as a word run\na formula node with holes\nthe new word fills the hole, lands at BUILD\nborn's canned text goes away"
s4: "4. sources\nsource() beside mother\nborn fills the definition node\nthe definition text runs; the meaning questions start (open)"
s5: "5. makes sense, at root level\nsame as last time? equal to the expected output?\nright, wrong or unchecked written on the memory"
s6: "6. back population\na told piece gets its word-run form\nreceipts re-pointed, the old form kept as the earlier version"
s1 -> s2 -> s3 -> s4 -> s5 -> s6

why: "why this order is free\na trigger can be written before the table it lands in exists (verified today)\nlaying is unconstrained; only firing is, and firing is what the typed lines control" {style.stroke-dash: 4}
